WEBVTT

00:27:58.121 --> 00:28:02.288
but they're on a roll. What if they
invest just a little bit more?

00:28:02.496 --> 00:28:05.954
It was like, OK, yeah, pumping costs.
That's a challenge.

00:28:05.954 --> 00:28:09.079
But like, look at all this
stuff we're figuring out.

00:28:09.204 --> 00:28:12.996
I think we were making so
much progress on making

00:28:12.996 --> 00:28:17.371
the prototype work better that
it gave us some hope, hope,

00:28:18.079 --> 00:28:21.246
even a sliver of hope can keep
a failing project alive.

00:28:21.913 --> 00:28:24.204
So Kathy decides to send a message.

00:28:24.246 --> 00:28:30.038
I just sat down at my desk at X and just
wrote an email acknowledging here was